{"id":"50f633353aed7a3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-model5-reduct.md","title":"ZFC Model5 Reduct","display":"df-zfc-model5-reduct — ZFC Model5 Reduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model5-reduct","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model5-reduct"],"display":"df-zfc-model5-reduct — ZFC Model5 Reduct","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-first-order-language]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model5-reduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model5-reduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model5-reduct — ZFC Model5 Reduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0,L_1,M,N,I_0,I_1\\in V\">\\(L_0,L_1,M,N,I_0,I_1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> are from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> are the registered language and intrinsic structure projections</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}sublanguage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0,R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nL_0=\\langle R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0\\rangle\n\\land L_1=\\langle R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_0\\subseteq R_1\\land F_0\\subseteq F_1\\land C_0\\subseteq C_1\n\\land a_0=a_1\\upharpoonright(R_0\\cup F_0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}sublanguage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0,R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nL_0=\\langle R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0\\rangle\n\\land L_1=\\langle R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_0\\subseteq R_1\\land F_0\\subseteq F_1\\land C_0\\subseteq C_1\n\\land a_0=a_1\\upharpoonright(R_0\\cup F_0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}reduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S(L_0,L_1,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI^{N}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}reduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S(L_0,L_1,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI^{N}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sublanguage inclusion now uses the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span> code expected by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>; the incompatible legacy five-place language code is not mixed into this definition.</li>\n<li>The reduct shares the universe and restricts the interpretations intrinsic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.  Quantifying arbitrary auxiliary interpretation triples would not connect them to the supplied structure codes and would make the reduct test vacuous.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_0,L_1,M,N,I_0,I_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}sublanguage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0,R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\nL_0=\\langle R_0,F_0,C_0,a_0\\rangle\n\\land L_1=\\langle R_1,F_1,C_1,a_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\\\\\n&\\land R_0\\subseteq R_1\\land F_0\\subseteq F_1\\land C_0\\subseteq C_1\n\\land a_0=a_1\\upharpoonright(R_0\\cup F_0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}reduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S(L_0,L_1,M,N)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SubLanguage}_S(L_0,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI^{N}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land I^{N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\n=I^{M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\upharpoonright L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2363,"backlinks":[{"id":"25c32e58877e8a51","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Reduct}_S$ (reduct predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-model5-reduct.md]])"},{"id":"330cd9261bcf72ce","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2755","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-model5-reduct.md|58-df-zfc-model5-reduct]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3888033a846b1cd5","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}